  first | exact @GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.Ar.Top.testPoly_facts | exact GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.Ar.Top.testPoly_facts | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.Ar.Top.testPoly_facts <;> assumption)
